{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_rell": {
        "attack": "【附加包】骑枪突刺，附带<#a974ffff>6+最大生命1%魔法伤害<>。<#ff9028ff>溃敌沉力<>：每个英雄身上单独叠，最多<#ffb900ff>5层<>，每层削减其3%护甲和魔抗，芮尔得到首层时它双抗的3%。",
        "skill": "【附加包】前冲一刺，<#ef5350ff>打破护盾<>，造成<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>晕眩0.65秒<>。<#ff9028ff>全速冲锋<>：与身边一名队友加速15%，朝敌人或彼此跑时翻倍；下次普攻或裂阵爆炸。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】跃向敌方英雄砸下，造成<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>击飞0.83秒<>，获得<#4fc3f7ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#4fc3f7ff>40%<>护盾，换成披甲步行作战<#ffb900ff>15秒<>。<#ff9028ff>驾临<>：上马冲锋，<#ef5350ff>晕眩0.6秒<>并掀飞目标。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_rell": {
        "attack": "【擴充包】騎槍突刺，附帶<#a974ffff>6+最大生命1%魔法傷害<>。<#ff9028ff>破鑄者<>：每個英雄身上單獨疊，最多<#ffb900ff>5層<>，每層削減其3%護甲和魔抗，銳兒得到首層時它雙抗的3%。",
        "skill": "【擴充包】前衝一刺，<#ef5350ff>打破護盾<>，造成<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>暈眩0.65秒<>。<#ff9028ff>全速突進<>：與身邊一名隊友加速15%，朝敵人或彼此跑時翻倍；下次普攻或鐵碎之擊爆炸。",
        "skill2": "【擴充包】躍向敵方英雄砸下，造成<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>擊飛0.83秒<>，獲得<#4fc3f7ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#4fc3f7ff>40%<>護盾，換成披甲步行作戰<#ffb900ff>15秒<>。<#ff9028ff>起駕<>：上馬衝鋒，<#ef5350ff>暈眩0.6秒<>並掀飛目標。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_rell": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] Lance thrusts with <#a974ffff>6 + 1% max health magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Break the Mold<>: stacks on each champion apart, up to <#ffb900ff>5<>, each taking 3% of its armour and magic resist and giving Rell 3% of what it had at the first stack.",
        "skill": "[Add-on] Thrusts forward, <#ef5350ff>breaking shields<>, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>stunning 0.65s<>. <#ff9028ff>Full Tilt<>: she and a nearby ally gain 15% speed, doubled running toward enemies or each other; her next attack or Shattering Strike explodes.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Leaps onto an enemy champion and crashes down for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>knocking up 0.83s<>, gaining a <#4fc3f7ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#4fc3f7ff>40%<> shield and fighting on foot in her armour for <#ffb900ff>15s<>. <#ff9028ff>Mount Up<>: charges on her horse, <#ef5350ff>stunning 0.6s<> and flinging the target."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_rell": {
        "attack": "[확장] 창으로 찌르며 <#a974ffff>6 + 최대 체력 1% 마법 피해<>. <#ff9028ff>갑옷 파쇄<>: 챔피언마다 따로 최대 <#ffb900ff>5중첩<>, 중첩당 방어력·마법 저항력 3% 감소, 렐은 첫 중첩 때 값의 3% 획득.",
        "skill": "[확장] 앞으로 찔러 <#ef5350ff>보호막을 깨고<> <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>와 <#ef5350ff>0.65초 기절<>. <#ff9028ff>전속력<>: 자신과 근처 아군 이동 속도 15%, 적이나 서로를 향하면 두 배; 다음 기본 공격이나 파열의 일격이 폭발.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 적 챔피언에게 뛰어올라 내려찍어 <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>와 <#ef5350ff>0.83초 에어본<>, <#4fc3f7ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#4fc3f7ff>40%<> 보호막, <#ffb900ff>15초<> 갑옷을 입고 걸어서 싸움. <#ff9028ff>탑승<>: 말을 타고 돌진해 <#ef5350ff>0.6초 기절<>시키고 대상을 날립니다."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_rell": {
        "attack": "【拡張】騎槍で突き、<#a974ffff>6+最大体力1%の魔法ダメージ<>。<#ff9028ff>革新の鬨<>：チャンピオンごとに最大<#ffb900ff>5スタック<>、1スタックで物理防御・魔法防御3%低下、レルは初回スタック時の値の3%を得る。",
        "skill": "【拡張】前方へ突き<#ef5350ff>シールドを破壊<>、<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>と<#ef5350ff>0.65秒スタン<>。<#ff9028ff>重槍突貫<>：自身と近くの味方1人が移動速度15%、敵か互いへ向かうと2倍；次の通常攻撃か破鋼撃が爆発。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】敵チャンピオンへ跳んで叩きつけ<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>と<#ef5350ff>0.83秒ノックアップ<>、<#4fc3f7ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#4fc3f7ff>40%<>のシールド、<#ffb900ff>15秒<>鎧をまとい徒歩で戦う。<#ff9028ff>騎馬<>：馬で突撃し<#ef5350ff>0.6秒スタン<>、対象を弾く。"
      }
    }
  }
}
